#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:895
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetGlare), group (Xplanet)
#: rc.cpp:1028
msgid "Sun Glare"
msgstr "Sünn-Överstrahlen"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:896
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetGlare), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: file: xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:257
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntSpinBox, kcfg_XplanetGlare)
#: rc.cpp:1031 rc.cpp:1411
msgid ""
"Draw a glare around the sun with with a radius of the specified value larger "
"than the Sun.  The default value is 28."
msgstr ""
"Teekt rund de Sünn en Överstrahlen mit en Halfmaat vun den angeven Weert. De "
"Standardweert is 28."

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:900
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetRandom), group (Xplanet)
#: rc.cpp:1034
msgid "Random latitude and longitude"
msgstr "Tofällig Breed un Längde"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:901
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetRandom), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: file: xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:815
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, kcfg_XplanetRandom)
#: rc.cpp:1037 rc.cpp:1596
msgid "Place the observer above a random latitude and longitude"
msgstr "Den Kieker op en tofällig Breed un Längde stellen"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:905
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetLatLong), group (Xplanet)
#: rc.cpp:1040
msgid "Latitude-Longitude"
msgstr "Breed-Längde"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:906
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetLatLong), group (Xplanet)
#: rc.cpp:1043
msgid "Place the observer above the specified longitude and latitude"
msgstr "Den Kieker op de angeven Längde un Breed stellen"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:910
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetLatitude), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: file: xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:767
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KIntSpinBox, kcfg_XplanetLatitude)
#: rc.cpp:1046 rc.cpp:1578
msgid "Latitude in degrees"
msgstr "Geograafsch Breed, in Graad"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:911
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetLatitude), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: file: xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:770
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIntSpinBox, kcfg_XplanetLatitude)
#: rc.cpp:1049 rc.cpp:1581
msgid ""
"Render the target body as seen from above the specified latitude (in "
"degrees).  The default value is 0."
msgstr ""
"Dat Teel so dorstellen, as Een dat vun de angeven Breed (in Graad) ankieken "
"dee. De Standardweert is \"0\"."

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:915
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetLongitude), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: file: xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:790
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KIntSpinBox, kcfg_XplanetLongitude)
#: rc.cpp:1052 rc.cpp:1587
msgid "Longitude in degrees"
msgstr "Geograafsch Längde, in Graad"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:916
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetLongitude), group (Xplanet)
#: rc.cpp:1055
msgid ""
"Place the observer above the specified longitude (in degrees).  Longitude is "
"positive going east, negative going west (for the earth and moon), so for "
"example Los Angeles is at -118 or 242.  The default value is 0."
msgstr ""
"Den Kieker op de angeven Längde (in Graad) stellen. De Längde is Richt Oost "
"positiv, un na West negativ (för de Eer un den Maand). Jaad liggt a.B. op -8 "
"oder 352. De Standardweert is \"0\"."

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:920
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetProjection), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: file: xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:838
#. i18n: ectx: attribute (title), widget (QWidget, XplanetTabProjection)
#: rc.cpp:1058 rc.cpp:1599
msgid "Projection"
msgstr "Projizeren"

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:921
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetProjection), group (Xplanet)
#: rc.cpp:1061
msgid ""
"The default is no projection.  Multiple bodies will not be shown if this "
"option is specified, although shadows will still be drawn."
msgstr ""
"Standardwies is \"Projizeren\" utmaakt. Wenn disse Optschoon anmaakt is, "
"warrt en Reeg vun Objekten nich wiest, man Schaddens warrt noch dorstellt."

#. i18n: file: kstars.kcfg:925
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetWait), group (Xplanet)
