"Willkamen bi den <b>Teleskoop-Inrichthölper vun KStars!</b>\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Disse Hölper ünnerstütt Di bi't Tokoppeln na Dien Teleskoop un bi't Stüern "
"vun dat Deert mit KStars. Du muttst en poor Grundinformatschonen pröven.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>Mehr Informatschonen över de Teleskoop-Ünnerstütten vun KStars laat sik "
"jümmers mit en Klick op den <tt>Hülp</tt>-Knoop halen, wielt de Hölper "
"löppt.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Bitte klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du wiedermaken wullt."

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:189
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, modelPageLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4839
msgid ""
"<h3>1. Telescope Model</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Please select your telescope model from the list below. Click next after "
"selecting a model."
msgstr ""
"<h3>1. Teleskoop-Modell</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Bitte söök nerrn Dien Teleskoop ut. Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du en Modell "
"utsöcht hest."

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:264
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#: rc.cpp:4844
msgid ""
"<b>Tip</b>\n"
"<br>Some non-Meade telescopes support a subset of the LX200 command set. "
"Select <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> to control such devices."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tipp</b>\n"
"<br>En Reeg vun Teleskopen, de nich vun \"Meade\" sünd, ünnerstütt liekers "
"de LX200-Befehlen deelwies. Söök <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> ut, wenn Du so en "
"Reedschap stüern wullt."

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:303
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, telescopePageInfo)
#: rc.cpp:4848
msgid ""
"<h3>2. Align Your Telescope</h3>\n"
"\n"
"You need to align your telescope before you can control it properly from "
"KStars. Please refer to your telescope manual for alignment instructions.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"After a successful alignment, connect your telescope's RS232 interface to "
"your computer's serial or USB port.\n"
"<br><br><br>Click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"<h3>2. Dien Teleskoop utrichten</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Ehr Du Dien Teleskoop richtig mit KStars stüern kannst, muttst Du dat "
"utrichten. Bitte kiek, wat dor Dien Teleskoop-Handbook över seggt.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Wenn Dien Teleskoop utricht is, koppel de RS-232-Koppelsteed vun Dien "
"Teleskoop na de serielle oder USB-Koppelsteed vun Dien Reekner to.\n"
"<br><br><br>Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du wiedermaken wullt."

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:337
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, localPageLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4856
msgid ""
"<h3>3. Verify Local Settings</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Verify if the following time, date, and location settings are correct. If "
"any of the settings are incorrect, you can correct them via the <tt>Set "
"time</tt> and <tt>Set Location</tt> buttons.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h3>3. Lokale Instellen överpröven</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Överprööv, wat de nakamen Angaven för Tiet, Datum un Standoort passt. Wenn "
"een dorvun falsch is, kannst Du ehr över de Knööp <tt>Tiet instellen</tt> "
"oder <tt>Oort instellen</tt> ännern.\n"

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:400
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, locationLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4862
msgid "<b>Location</b>"
msgstr "<b>Standoort</b>"

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:443
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, timeLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4865
msgid "<b>Time</b>"
msgstr "<b>Tiet</b>"

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:450
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, dateLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4868
msgid "<b>Date</b>"
msgstr "<b>Datum</b>"

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:467
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, setTimeB)
#: rc.cpp:4871
msgid "Set Time..."
msgstr "Tiet instellen..."

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:474
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, setLocationB)
#: rc.cpp:4874
msgid "Set Location..."
msgstr "Standoort instellen..."

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:528
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, portPageLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4877
msgid ""
"<h3>4. Determine Connection Port</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Enter the port number your telescope is connected to. If you only have one "
"serial port in your computer, the port is usually <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt>\n"
"<br><br>If you are unsure about the port number, you can leave the field "
"empty and KStars will try to scan the ports for attached telescopes. Beware "
"that the autoscan process might take a few minutes to complete. "
msgstr ""
"<h3>4. Koppelsteed rutfinnen</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Giff de Nummer vun de Koppelsteed in, na de dat Teleskoop tokoppelt is. Wenn "
"Du bloots een seriell Koppelsteed an Dien Reekner hest, is disse Koppelsteed "
"normalerwies <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt>.\n"
"<br><br>Wenn Du de Koppelsteednummer nich seker weetst, laat dit Feld "
"leddig; KStars kiekt denn de Koppelsteden na tokoppelt Teleskopen dör. "
"Beacht, dat de Söök en poor Minuten duern kann. "

#. i18n: file: indi/telescopewizard.ui:565
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, portLabel)
#: rc.cpp:4883
msgid "<b>Port:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Koppelsteed:</b>"

#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:31
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseRefraction)
#: rc.cpp:4886
msgid "Correct coordinates of objects for the effects of the atmosphere"
msgstr "Objekten-Koordinaten üm atmosfeersch Effekten topassen"

#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:34
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseRefraction)
#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:47
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseRelativistic)
#: rc.cpp:4889 rc.cpp:4898
msgid ""
"The atmosphere bends light passing through it, like a lens.  If this item is "
"checked, this \"atmospheric refraction\" will be simulated in the sky map.  "
"Note that this correction is only applied when using the Horizontal "
"coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"De Atmosfeer brickt dat dörgahn Licht, liek as en Lins. Wenn disse Optschoon "
"anmaakt is, warrt de \"atmosfeersch Breken\" op de Steernkoort namaakt.  "
"Beacht, dat disse Topassen bloots bi't Kimm-Koordinatensysteem bruukt warrt."

#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:37
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseRefraction)
#: rc.cpp:4892
msgid "Correct for atmospheric refraction"
msgstr "Atmosfeersch Lichtbreken inreken"

#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:44
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseRelativistic)
#: rc.cpp:4895
msgid ""
"Correct for the effect of sun's gravity on star positions, as predicted by "
"General Relativity, and verified by Eddington's experiment."
msgstr ""
"De Sünn ehr Utwarken op sichtbor Steernpositschonen richten, as se vun de "
"Allmeen Relativiteetstheorie vörutseggt un mit Eddington sien Experiment "
"pröövt wöörn."

#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:50
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseRelativistic)
#: rc.cpp:4901
msgid "General Relativity effects near the sun"
msgstr "Effekten vun de Allmeen Relativiteet blangen de Sünn"

#. i18n: file: options/opsadvanced.ui:57
