msgstr "Decken Grund wiesen"

#. i18n: file: options/opsguides.ui:253
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_ShowGround)
#: rc.cpp:5288
msgid ""
"If checked, the area below the horizon will be filled in, to simulate the "
"ground beneath you.  Note that the ground is never drawn when using the "
"Equatorial coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt dat Rebeet nerrn de Kimm infarvt; dat lett denn as de "
"Grund, op den Du steihst.  Beacht, dat de Grund bi't Äquater-"
"Koordinatensysteem nienich wiest warrt."

#. i18n: file: options/opsguides.ui:256
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_ShowGround)
#: rc.cpp:5291
msgid "Opaque &ground"
